 &lt;br /&gt; 
5. The Parent Company granted 357881 stock options to the eligible employees of the Parent Company, which are convertibles into equal number of equity shares of the Parent Company of face value of Rs. 10/- each, at exercise price of Rs. 40/- each, through Trust route under the DBO Employee Stock Option Scheme 2025 in the previous year. During the quarter ended June 30, 2026, 6600 stock options are forfeited due to separation of an employee before vesting of options. &lt;br /&gt; 
The Parent Company granted interest free loan to the DBO Employee Welfare Trust (Trust) amounting to Rs. 6.65 Crores (includes Rs. 1.15 Crore during the quarter ended June 30, 2026) and the Trust has acquired 677383 shares (includes 78383 shares during the quarter ended June 30, 2026) from the market at an average price of Rs. 88.59 per share. Acquisition cost of shares held by the Trust is presented as reduction in ‘Other Equity’. Share based payment expense for the quarter ended June 30, 2026 is Rs. 0.10 Crore (Rs. 0.10 Crore &amp; Rs. 0.28 Crore for the quarter &amp; year ended June 30, 2026 and March 31, 2026 respectively). The Parent Company considers the Trust as an extension of the entity and accordingly, incorporated the financials of the Trust in the standalone financial statements of the Parent Company. &lt;br /&gt; 
 &lt;br /&gt; 
6. During the quarter ended June 30, 2026, the Parent Company sold one of its sugar manufacturing undertaking comprising sugar and co-generation plant located at Meerganj, Bareilly, Uttar Pradesh, (“Meerganj Unit”) on slump sale basis for an aggregate consideration of Rs. 305.00 Crores which has been approved by the shareholders in the EGM held on May 18, 2026. The said Meerganj unit is transferred with effect from June 18, 2026 and full consideration has been received by the Parent Company resulting in the gain of Rs. 63.89 Crores on sale of the undertaking. &lt;br /&gt; 
The operations of the said Meerganj unit of the Parent Company has been classified as the Discontinued Operations for all the periods presented in these consolidated financial results, in accordance with the applicable accounting standards. &lt;br /&gt; 
